# Repo Boundary

last_verified: {{DATE}}

`{{PROJECT_SLUG}}` is a shipped-game repo in the Ship Shit Games portfolio.

## Owns

- The shipped **{{PROJECT_NAME}}** game and its scenes, gameplay, and UI.
- Game-specific runtime assets, audio, soundtrack, sprites, and art.
- {{GENRE_TITLE}}-specific content, data tables, and tuning.

## Does Not Own

- The reusable engine. Consume `{{ENGINE_PACKAGE}}` from its published package
  (or a temporary local `bun link` bridge for unpublished engine changes).
  Engine features and fixes belong upstream in `shipshitgames/shipshit.games`.
- Studio tooling: asset generation, the studio web/app/desktop surfaces, and
  the CLI. Those live in `shipshitgames/shipshit.games`.
- Canon. Lore is read-only, vendored as the `{{LORE_PATH}}` submodule.

## Rule

If it is *this game* — its levels, content, art, audio, or UI — it belongs here.
If it is reusable engine infrastructure, it belongs in `{{ENGINE_PACKAGE}}`
upstream. If it is studio tooling, it belongs in `shipshitgames/shipshit.games`.
Do not fork or rename the engine into a game-local package.
